content.text:
## Task: Create CSS variables and dark theme global styles
## Step: execute

Create web/src/index.css defining CSS custom properties for the dark-mode-only theme and global resets.

:root block must define:
--engin-bg-primary: #0d1117; --engin-bg-secondary: #161b22; --engin-bg-surface: #21262d; --engin-bg-hover: #30363d;
--engin-text-primary: #e6edf3; --engin-text-secondary: #8b949e; --engin-text-muted: #6e7681;
--engin-accent: #58a6ff; --engin-accent-hover: #79c0ff;
--engin-border: #30363d; --engin-success: #3fb950; --engin-warning: #d29922; --engin-error: #f85149;
--engin-sidebar-width: 280px; --engin-header-height: 48px; --engin-agent-min-width: 320px;
--engin-space-xs: 4px; --engin-space-sm: 8px; --engin-space-md: 16px; --engin-space-lg: 24px;
--engin-font-mono: 'SF Mono','Cascadia Code','Fira Code','Consolas',monospace;
--engin-font-sans: -apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;
--engin-radius-sm: 4px; --engin-radius-md: 8px;

Global resets:
*, *::before, *::after { box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0; padding: 0; }
html, body, #root { height: 100%; width: 100%; overflow: hidden; }
body { font-family: var(--engin-font-sans); font-size: 14px; line-height: 1.5; color: var(--engin-text-primary); background-color: var(--engin-bg-primary); }

This file will be imported via `import './index.css'` in main.tsx (T18).

Verification: File exists with valid CSS.

## Relevant Files
web/src/index.css

